Volume = {32},
Number = {3},
Pages = {3088-3121},
Month = {MAY},
Abstract = {This article aims to systematically analyse the main trends in
   formulating digital strategies aimed at environmental sustainability. In
   particular, it will examine the use of these strategies to foster the
   development of sustainable initiatives and the need for integrating
   technological innovation with environmentally responsible practices.
   Carrying out a systematic review of the literature, the study exposed a
   variety of approaches that encompass innovations in products and
   services, energy efficiency through smart technologies and the
   development of digital platforms that support the circular economy. The
   success of these initiatives depends significantly on collaboration
   between different sectors and the strategic use of data.},
