Volume = {7},
Month = {SEP},
Abstract = {The IoT has brought about a new paradigm in which a global network of
   machines and devices capable of interacting with each other is driving
   digital innovation in enterprises. Among various IoT sectors, the
   enterprise IoT has become the largest sector. In light of the growing
   importance of enterprise IoT and the research gap in this sector, this
   paper presents an IoT ecosystem, IoT architecture, and the IoT service
   business model essential for the selection and deployment of IoT
   services in various enterprise settings. Then, this paper illustrates
