Month = {OCT 9},
Abstract = {This data article presents a dataset which can be used to train machine
   learning (ML) algorithms towards intrusion detection and prevention
   systems (IDS/IPS). The dataset applies to the field of unified
   communications in voice over internet protocol (VoIP) networks.
   Information related to the design and implementation of a real
   enterprise VoIP network is provided along with the specific protocols
   used. The attack tools used to disrupt the VoIP communications and the
   resulting data collected are uniquely presented in sub-datasets.
   Guidance on how to use the dataset and benefit from the raw packet
   captures is provided to support research and development in IDS/IPS
